## Article

```catala
declaration scope A:
    input x content integer
    output o content integer

scope A:
    definition o equals
    if x>0
        then 1
    else if x=0
        then 2
    else if x<0
        then 3
    else -1
```

Note that `-1` is never reached.

```catala-test-inline
$ catala DCalc -s A
let scope A (A_in: A_in {x_in: integer}): A {o: integer} =
  let get x : integer = A_in.x_in in
  let set o : integer =
    error_empty
      ⟨ ⟨true
         ⊢ ⟨if x > 0 then 1 else if x = 0 then 2 else if x < 0 then 3 else -1⟩⟩
      | false ⊢ ∅ ⟩
  in
  return { A o = o; }
```

